func=jag::PacketHandlers::PointlightExtendAbove	func_addr=0x001e2610	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\ePOINTLIGHT_EXTEND_ABOVE direction\eSERVER opcode\e207 size\e3\n\nPayload: g1 value (raw; 0xf clears the override); g2_add pointlight id.\nSets light+0x154 with the override flag at light+0x155 on every scene light matching the id.\nEvidence: the light-gathering pass FUN_006d0150 computes the UPPER level bound from this pair --\n"hasOverride \e light+0x155; v \e hasOverride ? light+0x154 : lightType+0x1e; upperLevel \e v ? 3 :\nlight->level" -- and the LOWER bound from the +0x156/+0x157 pair (0 when set). Raising the top of\nthe level range to 3 is EXTEND_ABOVE; the sibling  lowers the bottom to 0.
