func=jag::game::World::Build	func_addr=0x0069d960	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=4480	cu_index_from_entry=863	text=CombinedLocationSection allocation + inlined ctor (949-4 Linux).\nPool acquire: r8 \e free slot index; lea r13,[r8+r8*8] (9x); lea rbx,[r8+r13*2] (19x); shl rbx,4\n\e> element stride 0x130. rbx \e poolBase + idx*0x130 is the intrusive control block\n{ctrlVtable, refcounts, self, objPtr}; the object starts at rbx+0x20 (r13).\n\e> sizeof(CombinedLocationSection) \e 0x130 - 0x20 \e 0x110. Valid offsets are 0x000..0x10F ONLY.\nObject fields written here (object-relative): 0x00 vftable\e0x01425520, 0x08 graphNode,\n0x10 entityType\e0x0C (COMBINED_LOCATION_SECTION), 0x11/0x12\e6, 0x40 plane, 0x44\e-1,\n0x48/0x50 worldRef shared_ptr, 0x58/0x60 enable_shared_from_this weak self (ctrl / this),\n0x94\e3, 0x98 plane, 0x9c posX (from element+0x14), 0xa0 posY (element+0x18),\n0xa8/0xb0 LocType shared_ptr (element+0x90/+0x98), 0xb8 shape (element+0x58),\n0xb9 rotation (element+0x59), 0xbc..0xeb blob (element+0x5c..0x8b), 0xec (element+0x8c),\n0xee/0xf0 shorts, 0xf2/0xf3 hidden flags, 0xf4, 0xf8, 0xfc, 0x104 (last write ends at 0x10B).\nFinally stored into the owning CombinedLocation's LocationData element (stride 0xC0):\nelement+0xa0 \e control block, element+0xa8 \e object.
