func=jag::input::Input::OnScrollWheel	func_addr=0x00cc1bb0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::input::Input::OnScrollWheel(Input *this, float wheelX, float wheelY). Reference symbol: jag::input::Input::OnMouseWheel(float,float,float,float).\nThe listener signature is bool(float x, float y, float wheelX, float wheelY) where x/y are NOT arguments - they are read from this->lastMouseX (+0x88) / lastMouseY (+0x8C), which only OnMouseMotion writes. Dispatches handler->onMouseWheel (+0x1C8, lock +0x1E0).\nConsequence for injection: move the mouse first, or the wheel event carries a stale position.
