func=jag::PacketHandlers::SetPlayerOp	func_addr=0x00141810	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=SET_PLAYER_OP -- handler body for ServerProt op 17 (varByte). Wire format: 1. u16 LE worldId (0xFFFF sentinel for no world); 2. CP1252 string text (e.g. 'Follow', 'Trade with'); 3. byte slot transformed via byteSubtract (server writes 0x80-slot, client reads -byte); 4. byte priority/cursor-visible boolean. Replaces the older op 0 SetPlayerOp which had a different wire format (padding+text+slot+0x80+prio+prio2). rev948 codec must use this new wire format.
