func=jag::ClientProt::RegisterAll	func_addr=0x000e4ab0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::ClientProt::RegisterAll (948-5) -- AUTHORITATIVE CLIENT->SERVER opcode/size table. Each ClientProt(&entry, opcode, size) constructs a ProtEntry {int opcode@+0; int size@+4; void*@+8} and pushes &entry onto the global registration vector (DAT_015d4140). size encoding: 0xFFFFFFFF(-1)\evarByte, 0xFFFFFFFE(-2)\evarShort, N>\e0\efixed N-byte payload. Opcodes are emitted in declaration order 0..0x81 (129). Key entries relevant to the world-login scene handshake: op56(0x38)\esize3 (CS2 IF_BUTTON-press variant), op74(0x4a)\esize5 MOVE_MINIMAPCLICK, op98(0x62)\evarByte (in-game telemetry batch), op105(0x69)\evarShort (queued typed-event stream, 1501B cap), op106(0x6a)\esize1 EVENT_APPLET_FOCUS (focus boolean), op107(0x6b)\esize0 MAP_BUILD_COMPLETE (scene-built handshake), op110(0x6e)\esize7 EVENT_MOUSE_MOVE.
func=jag::ClientProt::RegisterAll	func_addr=0x000e4ab0	kind=eol	insn_offset_from_entry=2691	cu_index_from_entry=464	text=ClientProt register: desc\e0x015d3a10 opcode\e0x4A(74) size\e5 \e MOVE_GAMECLICK (CONFIRMED). Game-world click-to-walk, single dest. Builder SendMoveMinimapClick \e\e0 branch. Payload: [p1 run][p2_add destY][p2LE destX]. (op58 \e separate UNKNOWN_58 varShort path move.)
