func=jag::ClientProt::SendMapBuildCompleteTrigger	func_addr=0x002f1d50	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Sole caller of ClientProt::SendMapBuildComplete (the MAP_BUILD_COMPLETE / op0x6B\e107 emitter). Reads the scene-build object from its context arg and calls SendMapBuildComplete; returns shared global 0x015db2a0. HYPOTHESIS: registered as a state/event handler (id 0x461, slot 0x0139afb0) by FUN_000851ae and invoked by the world-loading state machine only once the scene build reaches the complete state. Not statically called -> dispatched by id at runtime.
