func=jag::opcode::ChatSetFilter	func_addr=0x002d7d40	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=CS2 opcode CHAT_SETFILTER (cs2 op 467; cs2 script 9915 calls CHAT_GETFILTER_PUBLIC/TRADE then CHAT_SETFILTER). Emits ClientProt op114 (FIXED 3 bytes) \e chat filter settings. Wire: [op114][p1 filter0][p1 filter1][p1 filter2] (public/private/trade chat modes; 3 small ints popped from CS2 int stack, cached to client+0x10 / subobj+0x60 / client+0x14). Live-capture confirmed: clicking chatdefault:filters_click emits op114 (fixed 3). NOT window status. (Was mislabeled jag::opcode::SendWindowStatus by a blind 948->949 port; the real window/canvas-dimensions packet is op48 jag::ClientProt::SendDisplayInfo.) Descriptor 0x01683e30, registered id 114 size 3.
