func=jag::input::InputState::IsKeyDown	func_addr=0x00cc1b40	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::input::InputState::IsKeyDown(int keycode). Looks the keycode up in the rbtree anchored at 0x01685720 (root pointer 0x01685730); node key \e int at +0x20, pressed flag \e byte at +0x24. Returns 0 for keys never seen. Called with platform-native keycodes, e.g. Input::OnKeyDown checks 0x400000E2/0x400000E6 (SDL_SCANCODE-masked LALT/RALT) to decide whether the console key opens the console.
