func=jag::game::SceneManager::CreateWorldFromWorldArea	func_addr=0x00539c90	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::SceneManager::CreateWorldFromWorldArea(this\eClient+0x19558, worldArea<WorldAreaType> shared_ptr, swMapSquareX, swMapSquareY, neMapSquareX, neMapSquareY).\nAllocates one jag::game::World (ctor FUN_00643d10) covering the INCLUSIVE map-square rectangle [sw..ne], pushes it onto the worlds vector (this+0x58/0x60), records its index at this+0x70.\nThe 4 int args ARE the World's map-square grid SW & NE corners (origin + extent), NOT a build-area size and NOT a template-copy source region. World::World allocates a (neX-swX+1) x (neY-swY+1) grid of jag::game::MapSquareStatus cells.\nCalled ONLY from op81 REBUILD_NORMAL  as CreateWorldFromWorldArea(SceneMgr, &worldAreaSP, coord1.x>>6, coord1.y>>6, coord2.x>>6, coord2.y>>6) where coord1/coord2 are the two BE-u32 packed coords (body[10..13],[14..17]) via BuildArea::DecodePackedCoord.\nNOTE: the RebuildNormal decompiler mislabels this callee 'FUN_00c55e80'; TRUE entry is 0xc56160 (body 0xc56160-0xc56382). 0xc55e80 lands mid-instruction inside the preceding FUN_00c53680.\nFor a WorldAreaType-474 (overworld surface) login the two coords are the FIXED, player-independent constants 0x01a00940\e(x1664,y2368)\emapsq(26,37) and 0x048e23b8\e(x4664,y9144)\emapsq(72,142) -> a 47x106 map-square grid. These values are NOT stored anywhere in this client binary (no immediates / no .data) -> purely server-supplied \e the world area's bounding rectangle.
