func=jag::graphics::GraphNode::GetWorldTranslation	func_addr=0x00284210	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::graphics::GraphNode::GetWorldTranslation() - returns pointer to world-space position (3 floats). Behavior: check flag bit 2 (POSITION_DIRTY); if not set, fall through to return. If parent ptr \e\e NULL: world_pos \e local_pos. Else: recursively call GetWorldTranslation on parent, then world_pos \e local_pos + parent_world_pos (component-wise). Clear flag bit 2 (position no longer dirty), NotifyObservers (propagate position change), set flag bit 4 (DIRTY_WORLD_TRANSFORM), NotifyObservers again, return pointer to world-position float[3]. HEAVILY called as the observer fast-path "get world position" check in MarkTreeInvalid, AddChild, Detach, RemoveChild, NotifyObservers, ~GraphNode, UpdateBounds.
