func=jag::graphics::GraphNode::GraphNode	func_addr=0x00799bd0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::graphics::GraphNode::GraphNode (constructor). param_2 \e initial children capacity. Initializes all standard GraphNode fields. VERIFIED OFFSETS (match engine OGraphNode):\n- +0x0/+0x8/+0x10: DIRECTION_X/Y/Z (init 0)\n- +0x40-0x48: BOUNDS_MIN_X/Z/Y (init FLT_MAX \e 0x7f7fffff)\n- +0x50-0x58: BOUNDS_MAX_X/Z/Y (init -FLT_MAX \e 0xff7fffff)\n- +0x5C: marker (-1.0f \e 0xbf800000)\n- +0x60-0x78: SRC_BOUNDS_MIN/MAX_X/Z/Y (same init pattern)\n- +0xD0/+0xD4/+0xD8: LOCAL_X/Z/Y (init 0)\n- +0xDC: DEPTH (init 0)\n- +0xF0/+0xF4/+0xF8: SCENE_X/Z/Y (init 0)\n- +0xFC: FLAGS word (init 0; ends at 0xe7\e199 after construction)\n- +0x100: 1.0f (scale factor)\n- +0x130: parent GraphNode pointer (init 0; set by AddChild)\n- +0x138/+0x140/+0x148: children EASTL vector triple (begin/end/cap)\n- +0x158: inline children buffer base pointer (init to +0x160)\n- +0x160: inline children buffer (8 slots x 8 bytes \e 64 bytes)\n- +0x1A0: ENTITY pointer (init 0; set by callers)\n- +0x1A8: int \e 0xFFFFFFFF\n- +0x1AC: FRAME_COUNT int (init 0xFFFFFFFF)\n- +0x1E0/+0x1E8/+0x1F0: second EASTL vector triple (observers/listeners)\n- +0x208: inline buffer for second vector\nThe Vector triple at +0x138 reads child pointers from the inline buffer at +0x160 until grown beyond 8 children (then reallocated to heap).
