func=jag::game::WorldAreaTypeList::CacheReset	func_addr=0x005469c0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::WorldAreaTypeList::CacheReset (vtable PTR_FUN_01420580 slot 4). Empties this list's caches: clears the fromColour hash_map @this+0x78 (FUN_0085ad50) and the per-map-square composite LRU rbtree @this+0xb28 (recency list head/tail @+0xb50/+0xb58 -> self), then calls the loader-strategy reset (loader vtable+0x18). this+0x74 (LRU size) reset to this+0x70 (budget). See re-resources/docs/net/worldmap-worldarea-system.md sec 5.
