func=jag::PacketHandlers::LoyaltyUpdate	func_addr=0x001889f0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eLOYALTY_UPDATE direction\eSERVER opcode\e139 size\e4\n\nPayload: g4_alt1 balance (little-endian int).\nStores it at loggedInPlayer+0x44 (Client+0x19b30) and, only when the value actually changed, fires\njag::ScriptRunner::ExecuteTrigger.\nEvidence: this is the exact sibling of the confirmed JCOINS_UPDATE , which writes +0x40\non the same object with the same change-gated ExecuteTrigger; that handler's own annotation already\nrecords "its sibling op0xB5/LOYALTY_UPDATE writes +0x44".
