func=jag::PacketHandlers::SendPing	func_addr=0x00183160	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eSEND_PING direction\eSERVER opcode\e141 size\e8\n\nPayload: [0..3] g4 token0 (BE), [4..7] g4 token1 (BE).\nDecisive: this is the only handler in the bucket with no game-state side effect at all -- it\nimmediately builds an outbound packet and calls jag::Packet::SendClientMessage, echoing the two\nreceived tokens back (token0 re-emitted byte-scrambled, token1 little-endian) plus one locally\nsourced byte derived from client+0x534 (clamped to 0xFF, inverse-transformed). Pure echo/timing\nround-trip.
func=jag::PacketHandlers::IfSetcolour	func_addr=0x001974b0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eIF_SETCOLOUR direction\eSERVER opcode\e108 size\e6\n\nPayload: [0..1] g2LE packed RGB555 colour, [2..5] g4_alt1 componentId.\nDecisive: the 16-bit field is expanded RGB555 -> 0x00RRGGBB before storage --\n(c<<9)&0xF80000 | (c<<6)&0xF800 | (c&0x1F)<<3, i.e. each 5-bit channel shifted left by 3.\nStored on the component-override domain at client+0x19450 as update-entry kind 6.
