func=jag::PacketHandlers::MessageFriendchannel	func_addr=0x0014a7b0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=949 op26 MESSAGE_FRIENDCHANNEL (var_byte). CAPTURE-VERIFIED against 29B sample. Wire: g1 senderHasPrevName; gStr senderName; [gStr senderPrevName if flag\e\e1]; gStr channelName; p5 messageId (5-byte BE dedup); g1 crown; huffman body (rest). Sample: 00 "Yehp" "Ironman Btw" 04500018b6 06 <huffman>. See docs/949-1/net/social/friends-chat.md
