func=jag::PacketHandlers::UpdateInvStopTransmit	func_addr=0x00176cd0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eUPDATE_INV_STOP_TRANSMIT direction\eSERVER opcode\e10 size\e3\n\nPayload: g1 flags (bit0 only); g2_add container key.\nKey \e (containerKey << 1) | (flags & 1). Binary-searches the sorted transmit-subscription vector\nat Client+<inv transmit list> (stride 0x48), ERASES the matching entry (shifts the tail down,\ndecrements the end pointer, runs the element destructors and frees), then pushes containerKey onto\nthe 64-entry container-refresh ring at base+0xa8 / counter+0xb0.\nEvidence: that ring tail is byte-identical to the tail of the confirmed UPDATE_INV_FULL\n. Erase-not-insert on the subscription list is exactly STOP_TRANSMIT.
