func=jag::opcode::ChatSendPrivate	func_addr=0x002dbe10	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=208	cu_index_from_entry=48	text=CS2 opcode CHAT_SENDPRIVATE (cs2 op 1366, 2 strings: recipient, message). Emits ClientProt op71 (var_short) \e the free-text PRIVATE MESSAGE the client actually sends (lobby AND in-world). Wire: [op71][size:u16 \e payload length][recipient: pStr CP1252 via FUN_00acd630][message: gSmart1or2 length + Huffman-compressed body via FUN_007b3750]. Live-capture confirmed (op71 var_short ~13B). This is the server's real MESSAGE_PRIVATE. (Was mislabeled jag::opcode::SendDataReport by a blind 948->949 port.) Descriptor 0x016840d0, registered id 71 size -2.
