func=jag::ScenePicker::TestEntityHit	func_addr=0x0048bc90	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::ScenePicker::TestEntityHit. OEntity picking field offsets: PICK_TYPE\e0x14 (line vs point mode); SCREEN_X1\e0x18, SCREEN_Y1\e0x1C, SCREEN_X2\e0x20, SCREEN_Y2\e0x24, LINE_RADIUS\e0x28 (line picking); SCREEN_CENTER_X\e0x30, SCREEN_CENTER_Y\e0x34, POINT_RADIUS\e0x38 (point picking). Note: vtable offset 0x90 is the IsPickable virtual call (not OPathingEntity.NAME — that offset overlap is coincidental with a different struct).
func=jag::PacketHandlers::MapProjanimHalfsq	func_addr=0x000f1c50	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=MAP_PROJANIM_HALFSQ (S2C, top-op 168, zone sub-op idx 5, size 21). Half-square (finer) projectile via ProjectileList::Add. Like MAP_PROJANIM but srcCoord uses HALF-TILE resolution (iVar\e(b&0xf)+base*2, b>>4 for other axis \e> 4 bits/axis, *0.5 tile) and start/end positions carry packed 24-bit fine offsets. 949 wire:\n+0  g1  srcCoordHalf: X\e(b>>4)+baseTileX*2, Y\e(b&0xf)+baseTileY*2 (half-square units)\n+1  g1s destYdeltaHalf\n+2  g1s destXdeltaHalf\n+3  g3(BE) srcModel/id-A ((b3<<16)|(b4<<8)|b5)\n+6  g3(BE) id-B ((b6<<16)|(b7<<8)|b8) [flag bit from bVar4&1/&2]\n+9  g? bVar13 heightByte (@+12; *4 unless bVar4&2)\n+10 g2(BE) spotanimId (0xffff gate)\n+13 g1 bVar13b (<<4)\n+14 g2(BE)... +16 targetIndex byte (0xff->-1) then g2(BE)@+17<<2 (alpha/slot). See ProjectileList::Add. Total 21; verify field roles via capture.
