func=jag::game::HeightMap::GetFineHeightBridgeAware	func_addr=0x0047b470	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Bridge-aware ground fine-height query (client's real render/placement height). client+0x14068 \e LinkMap, client+0x14058 \e HeightMap. Steps: if plane<3 and LinkMap::HasBridgeFlag(tileX\eworldX/512, tileY\eworldZ/512)!\e0 then plane+\e1; then GetFineHeight(HeightMap, plane, worldX_fine, worldZ_fine, usePlane0Bridge\e1, addTileLinkOffset\e1); returns height+5. worldX\eworldPosXYZ[0], worldZ\eworldPosXYZ[2]; scale 0.001953125\e1/512 (DAT_00d66dac).
