func=jag::game::Location::SetupRenderNodes	func_addr=0x0015f990	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::Location::SetupRenderNodes. Verified Location field offsets (948-2): +0x40 int entityPlane (\e\e OEntity.ENTITY_PLANE 0x40); +0x50 ptr MapSquare* (worldData; base for HeightMap @ +0x14038 and LinkMap @ +0x14048); +0x58 ptr scene/world reference (activeWorldId lookup); +0x68 qword (renderNode alloc init data); +0x70/+0x78 vector<RenderNodeChild> (0x28 per element initially, 0xa0 stride after batching). These match the Location struct in Ghidra (renderNodeControlBlock\e0x58, renderNode\e0x60). WARNING: other OLocation fields (VISIBLE_TYPE\e0xC8, SHAPE\e0x120, ROTATION\e0x121, POS_X\e0x16C, POS_Y\e0x170, IS_DELETED\e0x18D, IS_HIDDEN\e0x18E, TYPE_ID\e0x1A8) are NOT observed in this function and require independent 948 verification.
