func=jag::game::InvType::DecodeType	func_addr=0x00588f60	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::InvType::DecodeType (config archive INVENTORIES\e5). Opcodes: 2\esize(g2); 4\ecount(g1) then count*(g2 objId, g2 count); 21\ecount(g1) then count*(g3 MEDIUM objId, g2 count). Opcode 21 is NEW in 949-1 (948-5 had only 2/4): 3-byte item ids for id space > 0xFFFF.
