func=jag::WorldSwitcher::CommitWorldTargetFromLogin	func_addr=0x001a8d60	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::WorldSwitcher::CommitWorldTargetFromLogin - copies the PENDING world target (WorldSwitcher+0xa8, populated by LoginStepHandleLoginData from the lobby login-success response: worldId@+8, host@+0x10, port1@+0x28, port2@+0x2a, isWorld/+0x2c\e1) into the committed WORLD slot WorldSwitcher+0x18/+0x20. THIS is how the LIVE flow sets the world target WITHOUT op212/op213: the lobby login response itself carries the world host:port (+ a session token at LoginMgr+0xf0/+0xf8). Called from LoginStepHandleLoginData. RE rs2client.948-5.
