func=jag::game::HeightMap::SampleRegionFineHeight	func_addr=0x0049b750	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Inner fine-height sampler (base bilinear + optional link-height addend). param_1\eregionHeightContainer, param_2\eout, param_3\eplane, param_4\efineX (mapsquare-local 0..0x7fff), param_5\efineY, param_6\eusePlane0Bridge, param_7\eaddTileLinkOffset(mode). Sub-container select: primary\econtainer+0x90, fallback\econtainer+0xeba0; ready iff byte[+0x11]\e\ebyte[+0x12]. byte[+0x159]!\e0 \e> not loaded (writes 0). Plane vertex-grid vec: begin@+0x160,end@+0x168 (0x10-byte elems, count\e(end-begin)>>4); planeGrid\e*(begin+8+plane*0x10). SPECIAL: when plane\e\e0 AND usePlane0Bridge!\e0, uses the plane-0 BRIDGE grid at container+0x1e8 instead. Bilinear over int32 vertex heights: col\e(fineX>>9)+1,row\e(fineY>>9)+1, col stride 0x18 (ptr array), row stride 4; blend weights (fineX&0x1ff)/(fineY&0x1ff), rounded >>9. NO scale (heights already fine-Z units, 512/tile). When addTileLinkOffset!\e0: result +\e SampleTileLinkHeightOffset(container, plane, fineX>>9, fineY>>9, mode) — the location/bridge height offset. Callers: GetFineHeight .
