func=jag::game::HeightMap::SampleRegionFineHeight	func_addr=0x0049b750	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=497	cu_index_from_entry=121	text=Returns &jag::g_constIntPool_0_3[0]. That pool is a 4-entry int32 array {0,1,2,3} in .bss, written once by the global-ctor at FUN_000e1770; ~100 unrelated functions hand out &pool[n] as a const-int result. Engine OHeightMap.EMPTY_CELL_SENTINEL_REL names this address: a returned pointer equal to it means the sampled cell had no height data. It is an absolute module-relative address, NOT a struct displacement.
