func=jag::PacketHandlers::ClientSetvarcSmall	func_addr=0x00117110	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eCLIENT_SETVARC_SMALL direction\eSERVER opcode\e6 size\e3\n\nPayload: g1_inv value (byte NEGated, sign-extended); g2_add varc id (hi raw, lo -0x80).\nEvidence: resolves the id via jag::game::ConfigProvider::GetVarType and writes through the\nCLIENT varc update manager (Client+0x19450) using CreateOrFindUpdateEntry(type\e1) +\nMarkUpdateEntryDirty + SetUpdateSlotValue -- byte-identical manager/entry path to the already\nconfirmed CLIENT_SETVARCSTR_SMALL  (which uses entry type 2 for its string slot).\nDistinct from VARP_SMALL , which writes game::PlayerVarDomain instead.\n1-byte value \e> SMALL width variant.
func=jag::ClientStream::Read	func_addr=0x00b724a0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::ClientStream::Read(this, buf, len) -> bytesRead. Single funnel for ALL raw S->C bytes (called from TcpIn/ReadBytes/MainLogic). Engine RawLoginDump hooks this to capture the raw login/RSA handshake bytes (pre-prot). ServerConnection+0x08 \e this clientStream; ConnectionManager+0x18\egame conn, +0x28\elogin conn. Verified 948-5.
func=jag::game::HeightMap::SampleTileLinkHeightOffset	func_addr=0x0047b2b0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=HeightMap secondary height source: per-vertex location/tile-link height OFFSET added on top of the base bilinear terrain sample by SampleRegionFineHeight when addTileLinkOffset(mode)!\e0. Grid lives inside the per-mapsquare region height container: count at container+0x1d0 (planes), int16 grid ptr at container+0x1d8. Cell \e ptr + plane*0x4000 + col*0x100 + row*4 ; each cell \e 2x int16 {s0@+0, s1@+2}. col\evertexCol\efineX>>9, row\evertexRow\efineY>>9 (mapsquare-local tile 0..63), both clamped [0,63]. mode 1 \e> return (int16)s0 ; mode 2 \e> return max(s0,s1) [under/over-bridge]; else 0. NOT interpolated (floor vertex). plane<0 or plane>\ecount \e> 0. Behavior-derived name.
