func=jag::PacketHandlers::TelemetryGridMoveColumn	func_addr=0x000f9ee0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eTELEMETRY_GRID_MOVE_COLUMN direction\eSERVER opcode\e199 size\e3\n\nPayload: g1_add to index; g1_sub from index; g1_inv grid index.\nMoves the entry at 'from' to 'to' in the column-header vector at grid+0x8, then loops over EVERY\nrow record in grid+0x50 (stride 0x18) performing the identical move inside that row's cell array.\nTouching one slot per row is the defining signature of a column move; the row-move sibling\n instead relocates whole row records via FUN_006c1840.
