func=jag::PacketHandlers::TriggerOndialogabort	func_addr=0x001875f0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt op123 (size0) \e TRIGGER_ONDIALOGABORT (jag::packethandlers::Interfaces). ADJUDICATED WINNER of the TRIGGER_ONDIALOGABORT name conflict (vs op162 ). Gets the InterfaceManager, reads the currently-open dialog interface id (+0xd8), and if !\e -1 runs the onDialogAbort hook via FUN_00295f80(mgr, id, 0x29) (gathers the interface's script-event vector and dispatches). Matches beta TRIGGER_ONDIALOGABORT \e Interfaces lambda#33 @beta 0x5b38e0 (InterfaceManager+0x100 !\e -1 -> GetInterface -> RunHookLayer onDialogAbort). Loser op162 calls SceneManager::PruneWorlds + sets a state flag (now FUN_000f1f30).
