func=jag::PacketHandlers::TelemetryClearGridValue	func_addr=0x000ed760	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eTELEMETRY_CLEAR_GRID_VALUE direction\eSERVER opcode\e159 size\e3\n\nPayload: g1_inv row index; g1_add column index; g1 grid index.\nWrites the 0x80000000 "no value" sentinel into grid[gridIdx].rows[rowIdx].cells[colIdx]\n(telemetry grid manager Client+0x193d8, grid stride 0x68, row vector at grid+0x50 with 0x18-byte\nrow records).\nEvidence: the same 0x80000000 sentinel and the same grid+0x50 row layout are written by the\nalready confirmed TELEMETRY_GRID_FULL  when it fills empty cells.
