func=jag::PacketHandlers::ClientSetvarcLarge	func_addr=0x00117050	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eCLIENT_SETVARC_LARGE direction\eSERVER opcode\e40 size\e6\n\nPayload: [0..1] g2LE varcId, [2..5] g4 value (BE).\nResolves the type via ConfigProvider::GetVarType with the VARCLIENT type list  (same list\nas the confirmed ClientSetvarcstrLarge), then writes into the CLIENT var domain at client+0x19450\nusing update-entry kind 1 (int varc); kind 2 is the string varc used by ClientSetvarcstrLarge.\nPlayer-var counterpart VarpLarge uses domain client+0x19b40 and list 0x01457040.
func=jag::PacketHandlers::ClientSetvarcbitLarge	func_addr=0x001171d0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eCLIENT_SETVARCBIT_LARGE direction\eSERVER opcode\e50 size\e6\n\nPayload: [0..3] g4_alt1 value (LE), [4..5] g2_add_LE varcbitId.\nBit variant: resolves the bit type through the dynamic lookup (state\e\e4 -> provider+0x230 -> +0x38,\nvftable+0x40) with the shared default bit-type object 0x01457030 -- the identical marker used by the\nconfirmed VarbitSmall. Writes into the CLIENT var domain at client+0x19450 (varcbit setter\n0x00ada260, which masks by the type's startBit/endBit at +0x48/+0x4c).\nPlayer-var counterpart VarbitLarge uses domain client+0x19b40.
func=jag::game::ConfigProvider::GetVarType	func_addr=0x00589cc0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::ConfigProvider::GetVarType. Looks up a VarType across all domains: checks enum field at this+0x3c \e\e 4, then selects one of seven domain type-lists (Player/NPC/Client/Clan/ClanSetting/World/PlayerGroup) by comparing domainTag against the domain-tag globals, and virtual-dispatches GetType(varId) through that list. Called from packet handlers (LoginProtocolHandler, LoginStepWaitingServerClientVar), script ops (SET_VARC_STR_SMALL), quest_varpreq_met, player_group_member_get_same_world_var, lc_get_multivar, etc.
