func=jag::ClientProt::SendWorldlistFetch	func_addr=0x00198200	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=CONFIRMED WORLDLIST_FETCH for 949-4. Descriptor 0x01683d80 registered at opcode 125, size 4 (RegisterAll ). Payload is one p4 \e the cached worldlist version at [this+0x10]+0x60, or 0 when nothing is cached. Afterwards sets this+0xb0 \e 1 (request in flight) and this+0xc0 \e now(ms). Sole caller 0x003d1d20 is a CS2 op gated on client state 0x1e/0x14 that rate-limits on the +0xb8/+0xc0 timestamps against the +0xc8/+0xcc intervals and pushes 0 (requested) or 1 (skipped) back onto the CS2 int stack.
