func=jag::PacketHandlers::CamMoveto	func_addr=0x000efb00	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eCAM_MOVETO direction\eSERVER opcode\e119 size\e6\n\nPayload: [0] g1_inv localZ, [1..2] g2 height (<<2), [3] g1_inv speed, [4] g1_add localX,\n[5] g1_add accel.\nLocal tile coords are promoted to world coords as (local + camBase)*512 + 256 using the Camera\nobject at client+0x19420 (CAMERA in the engine offset table), fields +0x60c / +0x608.\n\nMOVETO (not LOOKAT) proof: the helper it calls (0x0027c430) drives the camera controller group at\nctrl+0x48/0x50/0x58 via setter 0x00aee1b0. That group's mode factory (0x00668ab0) builds only 3\ndistinct classes, matching the 3 Position* mode classes (PositionPoint/PositionEntity/\nPositionSpline); the sibling group builds 5, matching the 5 Lookat* classes. Independently, this\ngroup's element getter is invoked with an out-parameter plus a double\n(GetPositionData(PositionData&,double)) while the sibling group's takes one out-parameter\n(GetLookatData(LookatData&)). Setter arity also matches MoveTo(int,int,int,int,int,bool,Vector3&).\nLOOKAT is the sibling handler CamLookat.
func=jag::game::DoOpSelectLoc	func_addr=0x001634b0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=DoAction SELECT_OBJECT (loc select / "use X on loc"). Registered as MiniMenu action object DAT_01448640, whose static init (FUN_000af050 ) sets id\e1, kind\e3; the MiniMenu ctor (FUN_00078b4e ) installs this function as that object's sender (base+0x18). Distinct from DoOpLoc1..6: picks descriptor DAT_016844b0 (ClientProt op 9, fixed size 17) when g_protocolRevision < 0x3b5, else DAT_01683e10 (op 116, fixed size 18). SendOpLoc special-cases exactly those two descriptors to additionally emit the pending selection state (client+0x26c/+0x270/+0x274), which the six plain loc ops never write. Independently corroborated by FUN_001cdfa0, which groups DAT_01448640 with the other select-family action objects (SELECT_TILE 0x01448840, SELECT_NPC 0x01448480, SELECT_GROUND_ITEM 0x01448280, PLAYER_SELECT 0x01448300, COMP_ON_PLAYER 0x014482c0, SELECT_COMPONENT_ITEM 0x01447e00) and no other loc action.
