func=jag::PacketHandlers::IfSetplayermodelSelf	func_addr=0x00187dd0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eIF_SETPLAYERMODEL_SELF direction\eSERVER opcode\e117 size\e4\n\nPayload: g4_alt1 packed interface+component id only.\nSetComponentProperty(mgr, componentId, kind\e5, value\eloggedInPlayer+0x48 (local player id),\nextra\e0) -- identical to IF_SETPLAYERHEAD  except for the kind constant, hence the\n_SELF suffix.\nEvidence: kind 5 is the player-MODEL family (kind 1 \e plain model id , kind 2 \e npc head\n\e confirmed IF_SETNPCHEAD, kind 3 \e player head). Its family members are this SELF form, the\nsnapshot form , and a (u16 + int) form .\nResidual risk: head-vs-model orientation is inferred from the component model-type enum ordering\n(kinds 1 and 2 proven in-binary); the consumer of the kind field was not located.
