func=jag::PacketHandlers::UpdateZonePartialEnclosed	func_addr=0x000ecf10	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=UPDATE_ZONE_PARTIAL_ENCLOSED (op109). Header: b0\elevel(byteInverse), b1\ezoneX(byteSubtract, base+0x608), b2\ezoneY(byteSubtract, base+0x60c). Then sub-op loop over g_zoneSubProtVector (bound<\e0x15); per entry size@+4, if +0x20!\e0 call decoder@+0x28 else skip size bytes. 949 sub-op table (idx:size): 0:10 1:vB 2:vB 3:7 4:20 5:21 6:11 7:3 8:2 9:5 10:14 11:8 12:7 13:6 14:7 15:11 16:29 17:4. Confirmed idx15\eMAP_ANIM(bind), 4\eMAP_PROJANIM,5\eMAP_PROJANIM_HALFSQ,6\eSOUND_VORBIS_AREA,7\eOBJ_DEL,8\eLOC_DEL,10\eMAP_ANIM_ALT,16\eMAP_PROJANIM_HALFSQ_ALT,17\eOBJ_DEL_big,13\eOBJ_ADD_big,9\eOBJ_ADD,0\eSOUND_AREA. Ambiguous(size-collision, need capture): {1,2}\eLOC_ADD_CHANGE/TEXT_COORD; {3,12,14}\eOBJ_COUNT/OBJ_REVEAL/LOC_ANIM; 11\eOBJ_COUNT_big/OBJ_REVEAL_big.
