func=jag::ClientCrashReportingDataProvider::GetAddress	func_addr=0x00317520	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Returns the client's current server address as a "scheme://host:port" string for the crash/diagnostic report.\n\nResolves the active WorldLobbyData through the owning Client, then inlines the whole body of WorldLobbyData::GetHTTPURL rather than calling it. Yields an empty string when no world data is currently held.\n\nSlot 0 of the ClientCrashReportingDataProvider vtable, a subobject embedded in Client and installed by the Client constructor. Sibling slots in the same vtable supply the username, mode, client type/token and the player-state diagnostic packet.
